---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="About" description="Main quest: life. Side quests: kayak fishing, homelab projects and whatever comes next, from the San Antonio area.">
  <div class="wrap page prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Main Quest: Life. Side Quest: Everything Else.</h1>
    <!-- About copy approved by Dan Oct 27, 2026 (drafted by Hoshi). Photo placeholder: src/assets/about.jpg still to come. -->
    <p>I'm Dan, and I'm based in the San Antonio area. My main quest is simple: live life to the fullest. The trouble is, I get distracted. A lot.</p>
    <p>One day it's a sunrise kayak launch on a quiet creek, the next it's chasing bass along a brushy shoreline at Canyon Lake, and somewhere in between I'm rebuilding a server in my homelab at midnight. Every new hobby turns into a side quest, and every side quest turns into a story.</p>
    <p>Distracted Quest is where I share those stories. You'll find kayak fishing trips (the catches and the ones that got away), the occasional snag or lost lure, homelab projects, and whatever new rabbit hole I fall down next. I'm not a pro at any of it. I'm just someone who'd rather try something new than sit still.</p>
    <p>If you like the outdoors, tinkering, or getting a little sidetracked, you're in the right place. Grab your gear and come along. The main quest can wait.</p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      {site.topics.map((t) => <li><a href={`/videos?topic=${t.id}`}><strong>{t.label}</strong></a>: {t.blurb}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <h2>Follow along</h2>
    <p>{site.socials.map((s, i) => <>{i > 0 && ' · '}<a href={s.url} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">{s.label}</a></>)}</p>
  </div>
</Base>
